* One SG13G2 HV NMOS access transistor (W/L = 10/0.45 um, tech.inc) at the two biases it lives
* at in the crossbar: on (word line 3.3 V) and off (0 V), source on the 1.65 V source line,
* drain on the cell node, bulk at ground. For `cargo xtask bench-instance` (an operating point
* to time `load` at), not a validation deck.
*
*   cargo run --release -p xtask -- bench-instance circuits/snn/transistor/bench_access_bias.net *       --model models/snn --model models/sg13g2/psp103/psp103.va
*   va-cli sim circuits/snn/transistor/bench_access_bias.net --model models/snn *       --model models/sg13g2/psp103/psp103.va
.include tech.inc
Vd   d   gnd DC 1.75
Vs   sl  gnd DC 1.65
Von  gon gnd DC 3.3
Voff gof gnd DC 0
XON  d gon sl gnd hvn_w10000n_l450n_ng1 w=1e-05 l=4.5e-07 nf=1 mult=1 as=3.4e-12 ad=3.4e-12 ps=2.068e-05 pd=2.068e-05 ngcon=2 delvto=0 factuo=1
XOFF d gof sl gnd hvn_w10000n_l450n_ng1 w=1e-05 l=4.5e-07 nf=1 mult=1 as=3.4e-12 ad=3.4e-12 ps=2.068e-05 pd=2.068e-05 ngcon=2 delvto=0 factuo=1
.op
.end
